   the Mesa 3D library in 26.0.4 .
  <p>
   Wayland in 1.24.0
  <p>
   Gtk4 4.22.2 .
  <p>
   Qt 6.11.0 .
  <p>
   The nvidia driver is updated to version 595.58.03 .
  <p>
   The Python interpreter is updated to version 3.14.4 .
  <p>
   The XFCE desktop environment is updated to version 4.20.2 .
  <p>
   The GNOME desktop environment is also updated to version 50.1 .
  <p>
   The KDE desktop environment is available in Plasma 6.6.4, Framework 6.25.0 and applications in 26.04.0 .
  <p>
   The browsers available are: Firefox 149.0.2 and Epiphany 50.3.
  <p>
   Many applications have also been updated as Telegram-desktop 6.7.6 ,
   Thunderbird 140.9.1esr, Scribus 1.6.6, Libreoffice 26.2.2.2, Gimp 3.2.2, etc.
  <p>
   Long-term support linux kernels (LTS):
